{"id":"vod_sn_39186","vodId":"39186","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"末日时在做什么？有没有空？可以来拯救吗？","name_cn":"末日时在做什么？有没有空？可以来拯救吗？","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8cfd2247af27b3729a899ee421472c40.jpg"},"summary":"某一日，人类平静的生活因为一种名叫“兽”的生物的侵袭而彻底画上了句号。当最后的人类威廉（新井良平 配音）从沉睡之中醒来时，他发现，已经500年过去了，而威廉的身上，承载了人类延续的最后的希望。　　这个世界上能够和兽抗衡的，只有懂得如何使用圣剑的妖精，然而，这些妖精们将自己化为利剑，一旦能量耗尽就会面临死亡的悲惨结局。在命运齿轮的运转之下，威廉和妖精们相遇了。个性温柔体贴的珂朵莉（田所梓 配音）、沉默寡言我行我素的奈芙莲（上原明里 配音）、看上去懵懂无知其实高深莫测的艾瑟雅（Machico 配音）、率真直爽的菈恩托露可（荒浪和沙 配音），在她们的帮助之下，威廉能否夺回属于人类的领地呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/i6gpuzmmp21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/TTWtQVZ7fz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eDVNwpUKHQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/TZTANBE5n41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/jXRBkyE2jZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/j2J5pn91Xi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fA5aYJL4ae1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ZjvWr0uR3G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HH1pwwiaiG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Lnp6bYtNPi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uX13uWn5QL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/H7NwjuA3J51/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:49.524Z"}